---

NOT LEGAL ADVICE. This software extracts facts from contracts, quotes its
sources and computes dates. It does not interpret contracts, does not give
legal advice, and is not a substitute for a qualified professional reviewing
the underlying documents. Every value it produces is a proposal requiring human
approval before it reaches the register.

